{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2019-10-24 22:30:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. INCREASES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 20, 2019', 'text': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.085 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 20, 2019 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 8, 2019. THE DIVIDEND REPRESENTS A 6.25% INCREASE FROM THE PREVIOUS REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.08 PER SHARE AND IS THE TWENTY-SIXTH CONSECUTIVE ANNUAL DIVIDEND INCREASE FOR THE COMPANY.'}